.build-kaobook/
.build-scrbook/
*.prior.pdf
*.prior.bib
# All built artifacts. Filename format is
#   `<short-title>-v<major>.<minor>.<patch>{k,s}.pdf`  (PDF, target-suffixed)
#   `<short-title>-v<major>.<minor>.<patch>.md`        (assembled markdown, target-agnostic)
# The trailing single-letter suffix on the PDF distinguishes the kaobook (k)
# and scrbook (s) renderings of the same canonical assembled markdown.
# Track a PDF or MD only when it's a tagged release worth pinning.
*-v*.pdf
*-v*.md
